[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Insufficient Authentication and Authorization vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the API design relies on a token-based mechanism for authenticating and authorizing access to sensitive operations, such as registering heartbeats and retrieving service statuses. If the token validation is not implemented securely or if the token is predictable, improperly stored, or transmitted insecurely, unauthorized users could potentially gain access to the API endpoints. This could lead to unauthorized access to service data or manipulation of the service monitoring system, compromising its integrity and confidentiality.

